'''Brock''' (Japanese: '''タケシ''' ''Takeshi'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Take a {{e|Fighting}} Energy from your Energy Zone and attach it to {{TCGP|Golem}} or {{TCGP|Onix}}.
}}

